#: ../../source/docs/common-logs.rst:10 274e084deb9c41278a7e7355ad205341
msgid ""
"There are two ways to record your flight data. With some exceptions, the two"
" methods record very similar data but in different ways:"
msgstr "记录飞行数据有两种方式。除少数例外，两种方式记录的数据非常相似，但方式不同："

#: ../../source/docs/common-logs.rst:13 407409adf79d42608e50def3f33c044b
msgid ""
":ref:`Dataflash logs <common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-"
"planner>` are recorded on the autopilot (often to the SD card) so they must "
"be downloaded from the autopilot after a flight"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Dataflash 日志 <common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-"
"planner>` 记录在飞控上（通常保存到 SD 卡），因此必须在飞行后从飞控下载"

#: ../../source/docs/common-logs.rst:14 6d09ae08e3614d79bdac51ab10c01aa2
msgid ""
":ref:`Telemetry logs <planner:mission-planner-telemetry-logs>` (also known "
"as \"Tlogs\") are recorded by the ground station (i.e. Mission Planner) on "
"the local PC when the autopilot is connected via a :ref:`telemetry link "
"<common-telemetry-landingpage>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`数传日志 <planner:mission-planner-telemetry-logs>` （也称为 「Tlog」）在飞控通过 "
":ref:`数传链路 <common-telemetry-landingpage>` 连接时，由地面站（即 Mission "
"Planner）记录在本地电脑上"

#: ../../source/docs/common-logs.rst:16 f8bde48cd3764e1ea81a1a00bfb02a6b
msgid ""
"If you are not yet familiar with the basics of these log files, first review"
" the introductory pages to understand where these logs are stored and how "
"you can download and view the information held within them."
msgstr "如果您还不熟悉这些日志文件的基础知识，请先阅读介绍页面，了解这些日志存储的位置以及如何下载和查看其中的信息。"

